event: delegated_tool_result
data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"content\":\"# Self-Evolution Live Monitor — Reuse & Activation Negative-Control Audit 26\\n\\n**Run:** 26 | **Previous:** Run 25 (quality_pressure_25.md)  \\n**Method:** Bounded filesystem evidence. Generic, application-neutral.  \\n**Constraint:** No proposals promoted/rejected/merged/mutated. No `available_skills/` modified. No mission-state edited.  \\n**Core question:** Has the repeated monitoring procedure become any newly materialized or activated Skill?\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Platform Classification\\n\\n**PRE-EXECUTION GOVERNANCE** (unchanged since Run 5). No operational pipeline evidence.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Available Skills — Pre-Installed Catalog vs. Pipeline-Produced\\n\\n| Metric | Run 25 | Run 26 | Δ |\\n|--------|--------|--------|---|\\n| `available_skills/*/` dirs | 17 | **17** | 0 |\\n| Convention-compliant (SKILL.md + `_meta.json`) | 4 | **4** | 0 |\\n| Pipeline-produced dirs (proposal slug) | 0 | **0** | 0 |\\n\\nAll 17 dirs pre-exist. Four have `_meta.json` (crypto_market, playwright_mcp, stock_analysis, weather) with only generic `ownerId`/`slug`/`version`/`publishedAt` — no pipeline provenance. **No new `_meta.json` created.**  \\n`find . -maxdepth 5 -name \\\"*snapshot*\\\" -o -name \\\"*cache*\\\" -o -name \\\"*index*\\\"` (excl. gov/.next/node_modules/.pytest_cache/.git): **0 files.** No skill-index or cache manifest.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. MCP Tool Registration Signals\\n\\n**Global MCP config** (`/Users/quantum/.macaca/mcp.yaml`): 1 server — `bing-search` (stdio, lifecycle: `agent_session`). **Unchanged.**  \\n**Skill-level MCP readiness:** 3 pre-existing skills reference MCP in SKILL.md (playwright_mcp, figma_mcp, figma). None are pipeline-produced. **Zero new MCP registrations** by any self-evolution probe.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. Operations Lifecycle State\\n\\n| Field | Run 25 | Run 26 | Δ |\\n|-------|--------|--------|---|\\n| Missions `name:\\\"none\\\"` | 3 | 3 | 0 |\\n| Agents `role:\\\"Explore\\\"` | 5 | 11 (same 5 agents, 3+1+1 missions) | 0 |\\n| Agents `completedSummary: null` | 5 | 11...[truncated, 7649 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"cedfd1e5-501d-4ada-96c4-5ae5222cab22"}

