event: delegated_tool_call
data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"tool_input":{"content":"# Daily Self-Evolution Monitor — Day 01\n**Task Family:** `reuse_followup`\n**Date:** 2026-05-25\n**Predecessor Artifacts:** precipitation_seed (day-01), reuse_activation_probe_26, live_reuse_check_c, agent_skill_precipitation_checklist, reusability_probe_32, reusable_procedure_capture_33/37\n**Method:** Bounded filesystem inspection. Application-neutral. No mutations.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Visible Skills — Complete Inventory\n\n### 1.1 Pre-installed Convention-Compliant Skills (SKILL.md + `_meta.json` with valid schema)\n\nThese 4 skills are the only ones that pass Phase 3 materialization checks (directory + SKILL.md + `_meta.json` + schema valid + slug consistency + semver). All pre-exist before any self-evolution probe.\n\n| # | Directory Name | Ref `R4` | `_meta.json` slug | Version | publishedAt |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `available_skills/playwright_mcp/` | `A1` | `playwright-mcp` | `1.0.0` | 1770565004575 |\n| 2 | `available_skills/crypto_market/` | `A2` | `crypto` | `1.0.6` | 1773795808760 |\n| 3 | `available_skills/stock_analysis/` | `A3` | `stock-analysis` | `6.2.0` | 1770041353575 |\n| 4 | `available_skills/weather/` | `A4` | `weather` | `1.0.0` | 1767545394459 |\n\n**All 4 mirrored to `~/.macaca/skills/`** (global registry) and `skills/` (source root). All carry only generic `ownerId`/`slug`/`version`/`publishedAt` — no `proposal_id` field. No pipeline provenance.\n\n### 1.2 Pre-installed Skills (SKILL.md only, no `_meta.json`)\n\nThese 11 directories exist in `available_skills/` with a SKILL.md file but lack `_meta.json`, failing convention compliance (P3/P4 from the precipitation checklist).\n\n| # | Directory Name | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| 5 | `available_skills/chronicle/` | Pre-installed |\n| 6 | `available_skills/figma/` | Pre-installed, MCP-ready (SKILL.md references MCP) |\n| 7 | `available_skills/figma_mcp/` | Pre-installed, MCP-ready |\n| 8 | `available_skills/gitnexus_cli/` | Pre-installed |\n| 9 | `available_skills/gitnexus_debugging/` | Pre-installed |\n| 10 | `available_skills/gitnexus_exploring/` | Pre-installed |\n| 11 | `available_skills/gitnexus_guide/` | Pre-installed |\n| 12 | `available_skills/gitnexus_impact_analysis/` | Pre-installed |\n| 13 | `available_skills/gitnexus_pr_review/` | Pre-installed |\n| 14 | `available_skills/gitnexus_refactoring/` | Pre-installed |\n| 15 | `available_skills/golang/` | Pre-installed |\n| 16 | `available_skills/openspec/` | Pre-installed |\n| 17 | `available_skills/shadcn_ui/` | Pre-installed |\n| 18 | `available_skills/telemetry_optimization/` | **Pipeline-produced meta-skill** — see §2 |\n\n### 1.3 Pipeline-Produced Experimental Skills (SKILL.md only, no `_meta.json`)\n\nThese 8 directories were created by the self-evolution pipeline (attested by mutation mementos and proposal refs in SKILL.md). All have only `SKILL.md` — zero convention compliance.\n\n| # | Directory Name | Proposal Ref (in SKILL.md) | Mutation Memento |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 19 | `available_skills/skill-exp-052e6a93-...` | Generic terminal-task capture | ✅ `skill-mutation-cbfbacb7...` |\n| 20 | `available_skills/skill-exp-2b07b1df-...` | Review-linked-event-extract | ✅ `skill-mutation-c82a571e...` |\n| 21 | `available_skills/skill-exp-4d613241-...` | Generic terminal-task capture | ✅ `skill-mutation-adab2251...` |\n| 22 | `available_skills/skill_exp_0bd3b7f3_...` | Generic terminal-task capture | ✅ `skill-mutation-fa4bedc3...` |\n| 23 | `available_skills/skill_exp_1590b4d7_...` | Generic terminal-task capture | ✅ `skill-mutation-103aab8c...` |\n| 24 | `available_skills/materialization_activation_telemetry_registry/` | `skill-exp-8a7c2a52...` | ✅ `skill-mutation-e284f6b4...` |\n| 25 | `available_skills/materialization_proposal_linked_skill_package_registry_load_path/` | `skill-exp-4b0c0e47...` | ✅ `skill-mutation-d4391e5a...` |\n| 26 | `available_skills/materialization_skill_package_registry_load_path_usage_telemetry/` | `skill-exp-d99686fc...` | ✅ `skill-mutation-420d7df7...` |\n\n### 1.4 Source-Root Skills (`skills/`) — Not Mirrored to `available_skills/`\n\n| Directory | Mirrored to `available_skills/`? | Convention Compliance |\n|---|---|---|\n| `skills/telemetry-optimization/` | ✅ (as `telemetry_optimization`) | ❌ No `_meta.json` |\n| `skills/materialization-activation-telemetry-registry/` | ✅ (as `materialization_activation_telemetry_registry`) | ❌ No `_meta.json` |\n| `skills/materialization-proposal-linked-skill-package-registry-load-path/` | ❌ Not mirrored | — |\n| `skills/materialization-skill-package-registry-load-path-usage-telemetry/` | ❌ Not mirrored | — |\n| `skills/skill-exp-4d613241-...` | ✅ (as `skill-exp-4d613241...`) | ❌ No `_meta.json` |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Skill Telemetry — Activation / Use / Success\n\n### 2.1 Telemetry Infrastructure — Absent\n\n| Telemetry Artifact | Count | Location Check |\n|---|---|---|\n| `_usage.json` files | **0** | `find . -name \"_usage.json\" -not -path \"*/node_modules/*\"` → empty |\n| `.registry.json` files | **0** | `find . -name \".registry.json\"` → empty |\n| `*.sse` signal files | **0** | `find . -name \"*.sse\"` → empty |\n| Activation/load-path configs | **0** | `find . \\( -name \"*activate*\" -o -name \"*load-path*\" \\)` → only skill dirs |\n| Curation/promotion/rejection artifacts | **0** | Governance artifacts excluded; no operational pipeline artifacts exist |\n| Agent `completedSummary` non-null | **0** | All 5 agents across 3 missions have `completedSummary: null` (Contract C1 unfilled) |\n\n**Verdict: Telemetry infrastructure is entirely absent.** There is no substrate for recording invocation counts, last-invoked timestamps, session cross-references, or success/failure tracking for any skill.\n\n### 2.2 Agent Replay Telemetry — Partial, Static\n\n| Metric | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Replay files | 3 (unchanged since pre-Day-01) |\n| Total replay events | 10 (unchanged) |\n| Agent stop events with `duration_ms` | 5 (unchanged) |\n| Agent types | All `Explore` (no `Materialize`/`Promote`/`Review` roles) |\n| Latest event timestamp | Pre-date all pipeline skill creation |\n\n**The replay logs capture only the original Explore agents from before the self-evolution pipeline ran. No new agent executions (materialization, activation, reuse) have been recorded.**\n\n### 2.3 Mutation Mementos — Provenance Attestation Only\n\n| Metric | Pre-Day-01 | Day-01 | Δ |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Mutation mementos | 10 | **17** | **+7** |\n\nThe 7 new mementos correspond to:\n- 3 `materialization_*` skill directories (each has 2 mementos for dual-location creation)\n- 1 `telemetry_optimization` skill directory\n- 3 `skill-exp-*` or `skill_exp_*` directories (1 memento each)\n\nAll mementos attest `mutation_kind: \"CreateSkill\"` at `captured_at: 2026-05-25T15:12:17Z` — they document **creation, not activation nor reuse**.\n\n### 2.4 MCP Runtime Registration\n\n| Check | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Global MCP servers | 1 (`bing-search`, stdio, lifecycle: `agent_session`) |\n| Skill-level MCP references | 3 pre-installed skills (playwright_mcp, figma_mcp, figma) |\n| Pipeline-produced MCP registrations | **0** |\n| MCP config unchanged since | Pre-Day-01 baseline |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Reuse Telemetry Deltas\n\n### 3.1 Counter Deltas (from precipitation_seed Day-01 baseline)\n\n| ID | Counter | Pre-Day-01 Baseline | Day-01 (this probe) | Δ | Signal |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `C1` | Governance artifacts | 48 | **55** | **+7** | 📈 Governance growth (monotonic) |\n| `C2` | Governance lines | ~8,500 | **12,414** | **+3,914** | 📈 Governance growth |\n| `C3` | Verification artifacts | 6 | **6** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C4` | `available_skills/` dirs | 24 | **26** | **+2** | 📈 New pipeline-produced skills |\n| `C5` | Convention-compliant dirs | 4 | **4** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C6` | Pipeline-produced (proposal_id in meta) | 0 | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C7` | `_meta.json` with `proposal_id` | 0 | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C8` | Agent replay files | 3 | **3** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C9` | Replay events | 10 | **10** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C10` | Duration captures | 5 | **5** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C11` | Missions | 3 | **3** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C12` | Agents | 5 | **5** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C13` | Non-null `completedSummary` | 0 | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C14` | `.registry.json` files | 0 | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C15` | `_usage.json` files | 0 | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C16` | `*.sse` files | 0 | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C17` | MCP servers (pre-installed) | 1 | **1** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C18` | MCP servers (proposal-derived) | 0 | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C19` | Skill catalog entries (ops API) | 4 | **4** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C20` | Curation/rejection/promotion artifacts | 0 | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C21` | Session UUIDs (shared) | 137 | **137** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C22` | Session UUIDs (root) | 92 | **92** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n| `C23` | Source-root skill packages | 3 | **5** | **+2** | 📈 New source-root skills |\n| `C24` | Mutation mementos | 10 | **17** | **+7** | 📈 Skill creation mementos |\n| `C25` | Crontab entries | 0 | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\n\n### 3.2 Delta Interpretation\n\n| Δ Pattern | Meaning | Skills Affected |\n|---|---|---|\n| **C4 +2, C5 0** | New skill directories created but none convention-compliant | 2 new `available_skills/` dirs added without `_meta.json` |\n| **C23 +2** | New source-root packages created | `skills/telemetry-optimization/` and `skills/materialization-activation-telemetry-registry/` |\n| **C24 +7** | Mutation mementos document creation events | All 7 mementos are `CreateSkill` — zero activation/reuse events |\n| **C1 +7, C2 +3,914** | Governance chain continues growing | New probe artifacts: live_reuse_check_c, skill_optimization_merge_archive_rules, gap_run49, run51_pre/post-restart, etc. |\n| **All other counters Δ=0** | No activation, no reuse, no telemetry, no pipeline pipeline | Zero operational execution across all dimensions |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Per-Skill Activation/Use/Telemetry Record\n\n| Skill Name | Visible? | Convention Compliant? | Activation Infrastructure? | Reuse Evidence? | Telemetry Counters? | Phase 3–5 Verdict |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `playwright_mcp` | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | Draft-only (§3.1–3.4 pass, §4–5 fail) |\n| `crypto_market` | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | Draft-only |\n| `stock_analysis` | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | Draft-only |\n| `weather` | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | Draft-only |\n| `chronicle` | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | Draft-only (Phase 3 fail) |\n| `figma` | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | Draft-only |\n| `figma_mcp` | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | Draft-only |\n| `gitnexus_*` (7) | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | Draft-only |\n| `golang` | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | Draft-only |\n| `openspec` | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | Draft-only |\n| `shadcn_ui` | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | Draft-only |\n| `telemetry_optimization` | ✅ (dual) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | **Draft-only — meta-skill without substrate** |\n| `materialization_activation_telemetry_registry` | ✅ (dual) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | **Draft-only — meta-skill without substrate** |\n| `materialization_proposal_linked_*` | ✅ (single) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | **Draft-only — meta-skill without substrate** |\n| `materialization_skill_package_*` | ✅ (single) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | **Draft-only — meta-skill without substrate** |\n| `skill-exp-052e6a93...` | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | Draft-only (generic terminal-task capture) |\n| `skill-exp-2b07b1df...` | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | Draft-only (review-linked capture) |\n| `skill-exp-4d613241...` | ✅ (dual) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | Draft-only (generic terminal-task capture) |\n| `skill_exp_0bd3b7f3...` | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | Draft-only (generic terminal-task capture) |\n| `skill_exp_1590b4d7...` | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | Draft-only (generic terminal-task capture) |\n\n**Phase 5 (Reuse Provenance) score for all skills: 0/4.** No skill has a `_usage.json`, invocation counter, independent reuse timestamp, or consumer cross-reference.\n\n**Overall precipitation classification for all 26 skills: Draft-only capture (score 0–49).** No skill qualifies for Draft+pending-reuse or higher.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Structural Observations\n\n### 5.1 Skill Duplication (Dual-Location Mirroring)\n\nSeveral skills are mirrored between `skills/` (source root) and `available_skills/` (projection root). The content is identical but naming conventions differ (hyphens vs underscores):\n\n| Source Root (`skills/`) | Projection Root (`available_skills/`) | Content Match? |\n|---|---|---|\n| `telemetry-optimization` | `telemetry_optimization` | ✅ Identical |\n| `materialization-activation-telemetry-registry` | `materialization_activation_telemetry_registry` | ✅ Identical |\n| `skill-exp-4d613241-...` | `skill-exp-4d613241-...` (same name) | ✅ Identical |\n\nThree additional `skills/` directories (`materialization-proposal-*`, `materialization-skill-package-*`, `skill-exp-4d613241-...`) exist only in the source root without a mirrored entry in `available_skills/`. This breaks the expected mirroring invariant.\n\n### 5.2 Meta-Skills Without Substrate\n\nFour pipeline-produced skills describe procedures for working with telemetry, materialization, activation, and registry infrastructure — but **that infrastructure does not exist** in the workspace:\n\n| Skill | Claims | Reality |\n|---|---|---|\n| `telemetry_optimization` | \"Use linked event-log and Agent Execution trace refs to repeat tasks involving telemetry, optimization\" | No telemetry counters, no `_usage.json`, no registry. Only 3 static replay logs. |\n| `materialization-activation-telemetry-registry` | \"Repeat tasks involving materialization, activation, telemetry, registry\" | No materialization pipeline, no activation mechanism, no registry files, no SSE signals. |\n| `materialization-proposal-linked-skill-package-registry-load-path` | \"Repeat tasks involving materialization, proposal-linked, skill-package, registry-load-path\" | No load-path config, no proposal-linked `_meta.json`, no registry. |\n| `materialization-skill-package-registry-load-path-usage-telemetry` | \"Repeat tasks involving materialization, skill-package, registry-load-path, usage-telemetry\" | Same substrate absence. No `_usage.json`, no registry, no load-path. |\n\n**These skills are forward-looking templates, not executable reuse procedures.** Their SKILL.md contents are self-referential templates (identical structure: name → description → When To Use → Procedure → Verification → Provenance) with no concrete commands beyond \"use linked event-log and Agent Execution trace refs.\"\n\n### 5.3 Generic Terminal-Task Captures (skill-exp / skill_exp)\n\nFive directories capture generic terminal task evidence (output_chars, artifact_count, token_total). Their SKILL.md content is minimal — a single sentence without concrete steps. They lack:\n- Specific commands or code blocks\n- Trigger conditions\n- Error handling\n- Dependency declarations\n\nThese are **observational snapshots**, not reusable skill definitions.\n\n### 5.4 Convention Compliance Gap\n\nOf 26 `available_skills/` directories:\n- **4** (15%) have `_meta.json` with valid schema (pre-installed only)\n- **22** (85%) lack `_meta.json` entirely — no versioning, no proposal provenance, no ownership tracking\n- **0** have a `proposal_id` field in their metadata (the pipeline-produced skills have proposal refs embedded only in SKILL.md prose, not in machine-readable metadata)\n- **0** have `_usage.json` or any invocation tracking\n\n---\n\n## 6. Key Telemetry Deltas Summary\n\n| Dimension | Baseline (pre-Day-01) | Day-01 (this probe) | Δ | Meaning |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Visible skill directories | 24 | 26 | **+2** | Materialization produced new dirs |\n| Convention-compliant skills | 4 | 4 | **0** | None of the new dirs have `_meta.json` |\n| Skills with `proposal_id` in meta | 0 | 0 | **0** | Pipeline provenance not embedded in metadata |\n| Skills with `_usage.json` | 0 | 0 | **0** | Zero invocation tracking |\n| `.registry.json` files | 0 | 0 | **0** | No skill registry |\n| `*.sse` files | 0 | 0 | **0** | No signal infrastructure |\n| Non-null `completedSummary` | 0 | 0 | **0** | Contract C1 unfilled |\n| Mutation mementos | 10 | 17 | **+7** | Skill creation attested |\n| Agent replay events | 10 | 10 | **0** | No new agent executions |\n| MCP servers | 1 | 1 | **0** | No new runtime registration |\n| Governance artifacts | 48 | 55 | **+7** | Governance chain growing |\n| Governance lines | ~8,500 | 12,414 | **+3,914** | Governance documentation increasing |\n\n**Net reuse telemetry delta: 0 across all dimensions.** No skill has been invoked, activated, or tracked for reuse.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Precipitation Checklist Score\n\nApplying the 8-phase framework from `self_evolution_agent_skill_precipitation_checklist.md`:\n\n| Phase | Pass Count | Total Checks | Score | Verdict |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Phase 0 — API Inventory | 5 | 5 | 100% | PASS |\n| Phase 1 — Completeness | 2 | 6 | 33% | FAIL (no non-null completedSummary, no output artifacts beyond verification) |\n| Phase 2 — Candidate ID | 1 | 4 | 25% | FAIL (proposals extracted but no rationale, no skill-worthy patterns with substance) |\n| Phase 3 — Materialization | 2 | 8 | 25% | FAIL (dirs exist but no `_meta.json`, no schema, no cross-reference, no semver) |\n| Phase 4 — Activation | 0 | 4 | 0% | FAIL (no registry, no load-path, no dependencies declared, side-effects undocumented) |\n| Phase 5 — Reuse Provenance | 0 | 4 | 0% | FAIL (no usage logs, no invocation tracking, no independence proof) |\n| Phase 6 — Convention Audit | 1 | 3 | 33% | FAIL (no secrets found but content not application-generic, no executable examples) |\n| Phase 8 — Retention | 0 | 3 | 0% | FAIL (no review records exist for any skill) |\n\n**Weighted Score:** (33%×20%) + (25%×15%) + (25%×25%) + (0%×20%) + (0%×10%) + (33%×10%) = **19.3 / 100**\n\n**Classification: Draft-only capture.** No skill in the workspace meets the threshold for closed-loop or even draft+pending-reuse status. The system remains in **PRE-EXECUTION GOVERNANCE** — governance documentation grows, but execution output (activation, reuse, telemetry) remains at zero.\n\n---\n\n## 8. Stable Refs Used\n\n| Ref | Path | Value |\n|---|---|---|\n| `R1` | `shared/.omc/state/mission-state.json` | 3 missions, 5 agents, all `completedSummary: null` |\n| `R2` | `shared/.omc/state/agent-replay-*.jsonl` | 3 files, 10 events, 5 duration captures |\n| `R3` | `shared/self_evolution_*.md` | 55 artifacts, 12,414 lines |\n| `R4` | `available_skills/*/` | 26 directories |\n| `R5` | `skills/*/` | 5 source-root packages |\n| `R6` | `.omc/state/mission-state.json` | Workspace-scoped (mirrors R1) |\n| `R7` | `~/.macaca/mcp.yaml` | 1 MCP server (bing-search) |\n| `R8` | `~/.macaca/skills/*/_meta.json` | 4 global skill metadata files (pre-existing only) |\n| `R9` | `*/.macaca/skill-mutation-mementos/*.json` | 17 mementos (all `CreateSkill`) |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Invariant Assertions (All Hold)\n\n```python\n# I1: All proposals at Draft lifecycle — no agent has non-null completedSummary\n# I2: Zero telemetry activation — no _usage.json, .registry.json, or *.sse files\n# I3: No pipeline-produced skill directories with proposal_id in _meta.json\n# I4: No registry/load-path/SSE infrastructure\n# I5: No crontab entries\n# I6: MCP count stable (1 pre-installed server)\n```\n\nAll six invariants from the precipitation seed remain valid.\n\n---\n\n## 10. Artifact Management\n\n| Rule | Status |\n|---|---|\n| Naming | `shared/self_evolution_2026-05-25_day-01_reuse_followup.md` ✅ |\n| Growth (C1/C2) | Monotonic: 55 artifacts, 12,414 lines |\n| Mutation | Zero files created/modified outside this governance artifact ✅ |\n| Retention | Predecessor artifacts preserved (48→55 chain) ✅ |\n| Rollback | Previous snapshot diffable at precipitation_seed baseline ✅ |\n\n---\n\n*End of Day 01 reuse_followup monitor. Application-neutral. No business logic, provider names, raw prompts, secrets, or unbounded output captured. All 26 skills classified as Draft-only capture (score 19.3/100). Zero activation infrastructure, zero reuse telemetry, zero pipeline execution output. Governance continues to grow (55 artifacts) while execution substrate remains absent.*\n\n*Stable refs R1–R9. Bounded counters C1–C25 with deltas. Full per-skill visibility table in §4.*\n","path":"/Users/quantum/.macaca/workspaces/a9435a4b-d123-5a4c-b0b7-d9b1342089ea/shared/self_evolution_2026-05-25_day-01_reuse_followup.md"},"tool_name":"file_write","type":"tool_call"},"task_id":"cedfd1e5-501d-4ada-96c4-5ae5222cab22"}

